B.ID=s(["FastAPI","Python 3.12","Flutter (Web)","SQLite","Google OAuth"],t.s)
B.Ia=s(["Complete ground-up rebuild: re-platformed an earlier single-language Flask/HTML prototype into a production bilingual (EN/AR) e-commerce system \u2014 new backend, new frontend, new infrastructure.","Built a custom localization system and content-picker pattern powering every page, label, and piece of content in both English and Arabic, including full RTL layout support.","Inventory: book catalog with SKU tracking, stock/quantity, weight, and page count, plus Excel bulk import/export \u2014 the non-technical business owner manages the full catalog independently.","Admin panel: tabbed interface (Books / Authors / Categories) with Arabic-language search, animated loading states, and review moderation.","Auth & security: role-based access (admin/customer), password reset, email verification, Google Sign-In (OAuth), environment-based secrets management.","E-commerce core: checkout/order flow, category management, bilingual content pages wired with real production business data.","Engineering: relational schema with coordinated migrations, FastAPI TestClient suite with lifespan-based DB seeding, and a cross-platform workflow \u2014 developed/validated on Linux, built and shipped from Windows."],t.s)
B.MY=new A.lg("Dar Alfeneq","The Phoenix Publishing House \u2014 reborn","Full Stack Developer (Solo) \xb7 Complete rebuild",B.ID,"https://alfeneq.com","alfeneq.com \u2197",null,B.Ia,!0)
