B.IZ=s(["I work across the full stack \u2014 backend, frontend, infrastructure, and occasionally hardware \u2014 because most real problems don't respect neat boundaries between disciplines.","A publishing house in Amman needed a functional website, so I built one in Flask. It worked, but it wasn't the right long-term foundation \u2014 so I rebuilt it from the ground up: a new FastAPI backend, a new Flutter frontend, and full bilingual English/Arabic support with proper right-to-left layout, engineered in from the start rather than added on afterward.","That same approach \u2014 build it, evaluate it honestly, and rebuild what doesn't hold up \u2014 carries through the rest of my work: reverse-engineering hardware for a custom macropad, running SOC monitoring shifts, and completing two Professional Certificates across 21 courses while shipping production code in parallel.","I care about systems that work reliably and that I'm confident standing behind. That's the standard I hold my own work to."],t.s)
